<title>FINLAND: PANOSTAJA 6-MO PROFIT SURGES.</title>
<headline>PANOSTAJA 6-MO PROFIT SURGES.</headline>
<dateline>HELSINKI 1997-06-25</dateline>
<text>
<p>Six months to April 97</p>
<p>				    (million markka unless stated)</p>
<p> Profit after fin items			  17.3 vs 0.1</p>
<p> Earnings per share (markka)		   2.66 vs 0.18</p>
<p> Net sales					   81.4 vs 86.9</p>
<p> Operating profit				  17.2 vs 3.7</p>
<p> Operating profit before depreciation	 19.9 vs 6.1</p>
<p> Extraordinary items				 1.2 vs 0.9 charge</p>
<p> Profit before appropriations, taxes	  18.5 vs 0.1</p>
<p> Net profit					   18.3 vs 0.4 loss</p>
<p>NOTE - Full name of investment company is Panostaja Oy.</p>
<p>-- Helsinki newsroom +358 0 680 50 245, news@reuters.fi</p>
</text>
